---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Approach | ARCBRIM BUILDERS" current="approach">
  <section class="section">
    <h1>Approach</h1>
    <p class="muted">Arcbrim Builders operates with a disciplined approach to engagement. We prioritize alignment, feasibility, and clarity before commitment.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Engagement Philosophy</h2>
    <p>Arcbrim Builders does not pursue work through volume or urgency.</p>
    <p>We prioritize alignment, feasibility, and clarity before commitment.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Engagement Stages</h2>

    <div class="callout">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Initial Evaluation</h2>
      <p>Initial contact is treated as a qualification step.</p>
      <p>We assess:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Project type and location</li>
        <li>Budget range</li>
        <li>Timeline</li>
        <li>Decision-maker involvement</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Incomplete or ambiguous inquiries do not advance.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="height:16px;"></div>

    <div class="callout">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Feasibility Review</h2>
      <p>If alignment appears possible, we conduct a structured review to determine whether the project should proceed.</p>
      <p>This may include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Site conditions</li>
        <li>Scope definition</li>
        <li>Risk identification</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This phase exists to surface constraints early.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="height:16px;"></div>

    <div class="callout">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Commitment</h2>
      <p>Once engaged:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Scope is defined</li>
        <li>Responsibilities are documented</li>
        <li>Communication cadence is established</li>
        <li>Changes are controlled</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not operate on assumptions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>What This Approach Avoids</h2>
    <p>This approach is designed to avoid:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Undefined scopes</li>
      <li>Reactive decision-making</li>
      <li>Informal change requests</li>
      <li>Compressed timelines without tradeoffs</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Clarity is not negotiable.</p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/inquiry">Begin an inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
